Comment:
 This is a native package built from the complete upstream tree, so it
 includes the third-party components under Telegram/ThirdParty/ and
 cmake/external/ that upstream vendors. Each carries its own notice in place;
 this file states the licence of the application itself as given in LEGAL,
 and is a summary rather than an exhaustive per-file audit, which is
 appropriate for a PPA rebuild.

